"Ontological_layer, all of its sub concepts and the properties layer_of and on_layer are work in progress in a premature beta state."@en <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> "Ontological_layer, all of its sub concepts and the properties layer_of and on_layer are work in progress in a premature beta state."@en .
