<https://w3id.org/gfo/base/Category> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Categories satisfy the following conditions: (1) Categories can be instantiated; (2) Categories can be predicated of other entities. Categories are defined intensional-with-an-s. They are, therefore, closely related to language."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
