<https://w3id.org/gfo/base/Function> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A function F is a universal (conceptual structure) defined in purely teleological terms with respect to a given goal G which commonly is ascribed by means of has-function relation to entities that are the realizations of the function F, execute such a realization or are intended to do it."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
