<https://w3id.org/gfo/base/Instantaneous_change> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Instantaneous changes are represented by change(e1,e2, u1, u2, u), where e1 and e2 are a pair of coincident process boundaries, and u1 and u2 are disjoint sub-universals of u. Instantaneous changes are therefore changes of properties on two coinciding time boundaries."@en .
